Hello,

I am giving away an API UP2000+ mainboard, 2x 21264 CPU modules (667MHz, 
4MB cache), and 2 GB RAM (8x256M).

The components are NOT in full working condition. At least one CPU 
module has a blown capacitor, and does not work. The board can be 
powered on with one CPU, but it is very prone to crashing, so it 
