However, they could be usable for spare or upgrade parts. AFAIK the RAM 
modules do all work.

If you are interested, and willing to arrange pickup, or otherwise cover 
shipping costs, please contact me by email. The components are in 
Tampere, Finland, postal code area 33720. The board is of extended ATX 
size, and weight with 2 CPUs is about 4 kg.

